# Oh-My-Research — search MCP API keys.
#
# Two ways to provide these:
#   1. Export in your shell profile (~/.zshrc, ~/.bashrc) — wins over .env.
#   2. Copy this file to .env in the project where you run Claude Code, then
#      fill in the keys you have. Missing keys = that server fails to start;
#      the others still work.
#
# Get keys at:
#   Exa:    https://dashboard.exa.ai/api-keys
#   Tavily: https://app.tavily.com/home
#   Brave:  https://api.search.brave.com/app/keys

EXA_API_KEY=
TAVILY_API_KEY=
BRAVE_API_KEY=
